Longer ReaxFF trajectory: the PEEK system of 02_PEEK_one_reaction (1030 atoms), timesteps
0 to 1000000, every 10000th step (101 frames, ~10 MB). File format: see 02_PEEK_one_reaction.

Reference values (regression check, recorded with the current code, not independently validated):

  rxn_bond_cutoff   reactions   unique rxnIDs
  0                 212         41
  1                 206         78

Reference output of write_reactions() (rxn_bond_cutoff 1): bonds.reaxff_rxnIDs_reference.dat

Usage:
  from atomigraph import AtomiGraph
  topo = AtomiGraph(infile="examples/04_PEEK_many_reactions/bonds.reaxff.dump",
                    atom_type_map="1:C,2:H,3:H,4:O,5:O,6:O,7:O,8:O", rxn_bond_cutoff=1)
  topo.read()
  topo.find_reactions()
